diff --git a/CHANGELOG.md b/CHANGELOG.md
index 4231e9d..f3508c3 100644
--- a/CHANGELOG.md
+++ b/CHANGELOG.md
@@ -2,6 +2,8 @@
 
 ## Unreleased
 
+- The default `pool.max_size` is 20, up from 10.
+- Loading rejects `pool.min_size` above `pool.max_size`, and a TLS certificate without its key or the other way round.
 - Looking up an unknown key raises `UnknownKeyError` (a `KeyError`) naming the closest key; `Config.get`'s default now stands in for unset options only.
 - Fixed: booleans written with capitals (`True`, `YES`) were rejected. A value that is not a boolean now lists the accepted words.
 - `load()` takes `files`, a list of `(name, text)` pairs applied in order, instead of `file_text` and `file_name`.
