@@ -119,6 +119,11 @@ layers are reported together; a syntax error in the file stops loading.
 | `msg.lookup` | `unknown key '{key}' (did you mean '{match}'?)` | Raised as `KeyError` by `Config.get`, `Config[key]` and `Config.source`, and printed by `get` and `explain` on the command line. The suggestion is the closest key or alias and is left off when none is close. The second argument of `Config.get` is returned for an option that has no value. |
 | `msg.unreadable` | `cannot read {path}: {reason}` | |
 
+Two rules across options are checked once every value is valid on its own:
+`pool.min_size: must not exceed pool.max_size`, reported where `pool.min_size`
+was set (equal sizes are allowed), and `server.tls_cert and server.tls_key must
+be set together`, reported where the one that is set came from.
+
